WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.405
Open trade history.

2
00:00:01.525 --> 00:00:05.995
After a virtual buy and sell, choose Trade History from More resources.

3
00:00:06.115 --> 00:00:08.820
Both fills appear in the completed-trades table.

4
00:00:19.874 --> 00:00:21.093
Inspect the trade.

5
00:00:21.213 --> 00:00:26.566
Use Explain My Trade to review a completed fill and read its breakdown before returning to the record.

6
00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:28.901
Open the journal.

7
00:00:29.021 --> 00:00:33.560
Use Open trade journal and analytics to reflect on the reasoning behind your trade.

